Here is an example code snippet to create a Tetris board:
```javascript
const boardRows = 20;
const boardColumns = 10;
const squareSize = 20;

// Create a grid of squares
for (let i = 0; i < boardRows; i++) {
  for (let j = 0; j < boardColumns; j++) {
